Baizhi is a beautiful woman of average height and build. She has seafoam green eyes under red eyelids and knee-length black hair with white streaks that has a low ponytail tied with a circular ornament though the sides of her hair from the back are loose, instead of going down with the tied bit of hair. Her hair is also tied with a gray tie, close to her head. Her Tacet mark is on her right thigh.

===Clothing===
Baizhi wears a black, strapless short wrap dress that has a slit on the right thigh, revealing a white clothing that has flower-shaped tips, and the left side of the dress is white, starting from her chest to her thigh, and a white clothing under her dress, exposing her chest, with a sheer layer beneath it all. She also wears detached long sleeves, black gloves that partially cover her hand, a thigh garter at her right thigh, and black heeled boots.

